---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="How to Order | David Dindi" description="A simple, transparent enquiry-first ordering process.">
  <section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> / <a href="/policies/how-to-order/">Policies</a> / How to Order</div><span class="eyebrow">Customer information</span><h1>How to Order</h1><p class="lead">A simple, transparent enquiry-first ordering process.</p></div></section>
  <section class="container content">
    <h2>1. Explore the catalogue</h2>
    <p>Review the product description, materials, dimensions and colour information. Some catalogue entries are still being verified.</p>
    <h2>2. Enquire before ordering</h2>
    <p>Contact David Dindi via WhatsApp to confirm current stock, final pricing, colour availability, lead time and delivery options. Your enquiry is not a confirmed order.</p>
    <h2>3. Confirm the order details</h2>
    <p>Before payment or production begins, confirm the product, configuration, total price, delivery arrangements and any applicable terms in writing.</p>
    <h2>4. Payment</h2>
    <p>Payment methods and payment instructions must be confirmed directly with the business. Do not send payment to an unverified account or number.</p>
    <div class="notice"><strong>Owner review required:</strong> add the verified business contact details, accepted payment methods, order-confirmation procedure and cancellation rules before publishing.</div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>